 {
  "coord": "277:15",
  "verdict": "FAIL",
  "category": "hedge",
  "note": "Source says an unnoticed glance; \"which she hoped no one noticed\" weakens a stated fact into a hope.",
  "replacement": "Princess Mary did not ask what \"still the same\" might mean. With an unnoticed glance at little seven-year-old Nicholas, who sat in front of her looking at the town with pleasure, she bowed her head and did not raise it again until the heavy coach, rumbling, shaking and swaying, came to a stop. The carriage steps clattered as they were let down."
 },
